                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Which payment gateway is best for India D2C?</h3>
                                        <p>Razorpay peak India D2C + Cashfree growing + PayU established. Match to primary features + integration + business stage.</p>
                                        <h3>Should D2C brands use multi-gateway?</h3>
                                        <p>At growth + scaling stage: yes — redundancy + method optimisation + regional coverage. Early stage: single gateway simplicity.</p>
                                        <h3>What is typical India payment gateway fee?</h3>
                                        <p>1.5-2.5% domestic + GST 18% on fees + higher for international cards. Volume-based tiered pricing negotiable at scale.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest payment gateway mistake?</h3>
                                        <p>Single-gateway lock-in at scale + poor fraud tools + missing regional payment methods. All three destroy unit economics + market entry.</p>
